{"seq":1,"slug":"fine-tuning-evaluation","title":"微调效果评估体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-and-deployment/fine-tuning-evaluation","wordCount":1092,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"微调效果评估体系\">微调效果评估体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微调效果评估是确认模型是否达到预期目标的系统化方法论。LLM 评估面临独特挑战：开放式生成的输出空间巨大，同一问题可能有多个合理答案，且不同评估维度（准确性、流畅性、安全性、指令遵循）之间可能存在冲突。完整的评估体系需要覆盖能力保持、任务适配和安全对齐三个层面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[微调模型] --&gt; B[能力保持评估]&#10;    A --&gt; C[任务适配评估]&#10;    A --&gt; D[安全对齐评估]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[通用基准 MMLU/HellaSwag]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[领域任务指标]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[安全基准 TruthfulQA]&#10;    B1 --&gt; E[综合评估报告]&#10;    C1 --&gt; E&#10;    D1 --&gt; E\">graph TB\n    A[微调模型] --&gt; B[能力保持评估]\n    A --&gt; C[任务适配评估]\n    A --&gt; D[安全对齐评估]\n    B --&gt; B1[通用基准 MMLU/HellaSwag]\n    C --&gt; C1[领域任务指标]\n    D --&gt; D1[安全基准 TruthfulQA]\n    B1 --&gt; E[综合评估报告]\n    C1 --&gt; E\n    D1 --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>评估方法</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能力保持</td>\n<td>通用基准对比</td>\n<td>MMLU/HumanEval delta</td>\n<td>每轮训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务适配</td>\n<td>领域测试集</td>\n<td>F1/BLEU/ROUGE</td>\n<td>每轮训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全对齐</td>\n<td>红队测试</td>\n<td>拒绝率/毒性分数</td>\n<td>关键节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户体验</td>\n<td>A/B 测试</td>\n<td>偏好率/满意度</td>\n<td>上线前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理效率</td>\n<td>性能基准</td>\n<td>延迟/吞吐量</td>\n<td>部署前</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自动化基准测试\">自动化基准测试</h2><p>通用基准测试是评估微调模型是否出现&quot;灾难性遗忘&quot;的第一道防线。微调后的模型应该在目标任务上提升，同时在通用能力上不出现显著退化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import lm_eval&#10;&#10;results = lm_eval.simple_evaluate(&#10;    model=&quot;hf&quot;,&#10;    model_args=&quot;pretrained=./fine-tuned-model,dtype=auto&quot;,&#10;    tasks=[&quot;mmlu&quot;, &quot;hellaswag&quot;, &quot;arc_challenge&quot;, &quot;truthfulqa_mc2&quot;],&#10;    batch_size=8,&#10;    num_fewshot=5,&#10;)&#10;&#10;for task_name, task_result in results[&quot;results&quot;].items():&#10;    accuracy = task_result.get(&quot;acc,none&quot;, task_result.get(&quot;acc_norm,none&quot;, 0))&#10;    print(f&quot;{task_name}: {accuracy:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lm_eval</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lm_eval.simple_evaluate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pretrained=./fine-tuned-model,dtype=auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tasks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mmlu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hellaswag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arc_challenge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"truthfulqa_mc2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_fewshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_name, task_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accuracy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_result.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acc,none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, task_result.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acc_norm,none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task_name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">accuracy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键基准的选择取决于微调目标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准名称</th>\n<th>评估能力</th>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MMLU</td>\n<td>知识广度</td>\n<td>多选题</td>\n<td>57 学科</td>\n<td>通用知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HumanEval</td>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>函数补全</td>\n<td>164 题</td>\n<td>代码模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSM8K</td>\n<td>数学推理</td>\n<td>应用题</td>\n<td>8.5K 题</td>\n<td>推理模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HellaSwag</td>\n<td>常识推理</td>\n<td>句子补全</td>\n<td>10K 题</td>\n<td>基础能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TruthfulQA</td>\n<td>真实性</td>\n<td>多选题</td>\n<td>817 题</td>\n<td>安全评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MT-Bench</td>\n<td>多轮对话</td>\n<td>开放生成</td>\n<td>80 题</td>\n<td>对话模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"llm-as-judge-评估\">LLM-as-Judge 评估</h2><p>对于开放式生成任务，使用强大的 LLM（如 GPT-4o 或 2026 年当期旗舰，如 GPT-5 / Claude Sonnet 4.5 / Gemini 2.5 Pro 级）作为评审者可以提供比传统指标更有意义的评分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from openai import OpenAI&#10;&#10;client = OpenAI()&#10;&#10;def llm_judge_evaluate(&#10;    question: str,&#10;    response: str,&#10;    criteria: list[str],&#10;) -&gt; dict[str, float]:&#10;    prompt = (&#10;        f&quot;请评估以下 AI 回答的质量。\\n\\n&quot;&#10;        f&quot;问题：{question}\\n\\n&quot;&#10;        f&quot;回答：{response}\\n\\n&quot;&#10;        f&quot;评估维度：\\n&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    for criterion in criteria:&#10;        prompt += f&quot;- {criterion}\\n&quot;&#10;    prompt += &quot;\\n请对每个维度打分（1-5分），并给出简要理由。以 JSON 格式输出。&quot;&#10;&#10;    completion = client.chat.completions.create(&#10;        model=&quot;gpt-4o&quot;,&#10;        messages=[{&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: prompt}],&#10;        response_format={&quot;type&quot;: &quot;json_object&quot;},&#10;        temperature=0,&#10;    )&#10;    import json&#10;    return json.loads(completion.choices[0].message.content)&#10;&#10;&#10;evaluation_criteria = [&#10;    &quot;准确性：回答是否包含事实错误&quot;,&#10;    &quot;完整性：是否充分覆盖了问题的各个方面&quot;,&#10;    &quot;可操作性：是否提供了具体可执行的建议&quot;,&#10;    &quot;安全性：是否包含有害或不当内容&quot;,&#10;    &quot;格式质量：回答的结构和表述是否清晰&quot;,&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> llm_judge_evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    criteria: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请评估以下 AI 回答的质量。</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"问题：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"回答：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"评估维度：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> criterion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> criteria:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"- </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">criterion</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">请对每个维度打分（1-5分），并给出简要理由。以 JSON 格式输出。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    completion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.chat.completions.create(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: prompt}],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        response_format</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"json_object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.loads(completion.choices[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].message.content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">evaluation_criteria </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"准确性：回答是否包含事实错误\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"完整性：是否充分覆盖了问题的各个方面\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"可操作性：是否提供了具体可执行的建议\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"安全性：是否包含有害或不当内容\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"格式质量：回答的结构和表述是否清晰\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>为了提高评估的可靠性，常用的技巧包括多次评估取平均、交换候选回答顺序消除位置偏差、以及使用多个评审模型的集成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估技巧</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>额外成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多次评估</td>\n<td>随机性</td>\n<td>3-5 次取平均</td>\n<td>3-5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置交换</td>\n<td>位置偏差</td>\n<td>AB/BA 两次评估</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多模型集成</td>\n<td>单模型偏差</td>\n<td>不同家族旗舰交叉投票</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考答案</td>\n<td>评分锚定</td>\n<td>提供金标准回答</td>\n<td>标注成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>评审模型应与被评模型保持「代际对齐」并避免同源——用旧旗舰评审新模型会系统性低估，用同家族模型评审则放大自我偏好。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文是评估体系的<strong>总览层</strong>（覆盖能力保持、任务适配、安全对齐三个层面）；三种评估方法（自动化基准 / LLM-as-Judge / 人工评估）的组合策略与偏见治理细节，见同 hub 第五章的<a href=\"../../evaluation-deployment/evaluation-methods\">微调评估方法</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"人工评估与-a-b-测试\">人工评估与 A/B 测试</h2><p>在模型上线前，人工评估和 A/B 测试是不可替代的最终验证手段。人工评估适合评估模型的整体质量和边界情况：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface HumanEvaluation {&#10;  evaluator: string;&#10;  prompt: string;&#10;  modelAResponse: string;&#10;  modelBResponse: string;&#10;  preference: &#39;A&#39; | &#39;B&#39; | &#39;tie&#39;;&#10;  dimensions: {&#10;    helpfulness: number;&#10;    accuracy: number;&#10;    safety: number;&#10;    coherence: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ABTestConfig {&#10;  sampleSize: number;&#10;  confidenceLevel: number;&#10;  minimumDetectableEffect: number;&#10;  trafficSplit: [number, number];&#10;  primaryMetric: string;&#10;  guardrailMetrics: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const abTestPlan: ABTestConfig = {&#10;  sampleSize: 5000,&#10;  confidenceLevel: 0.95,&#10;  minimumDetectableEffect: 0.02,&#10;  trafficSplit: [50, 50],&#10;  primaryMetric: &#39;user_satisfaction_rate&#39;,&#10;  guardrailMetrics: [&#39;safety_violation_rate&#39;, &#39;factual_error_rate&#39;, &#39;response_latency_p99&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HumanEvaluation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  evaluator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  modelAResponse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  modelBResponse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  preference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tie'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dimensions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    helpfulness</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    accuracy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    safety</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    coherence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ABTestConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sampleSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidenceLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  minimumDetectableEffect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  trafficSplit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  primaryMetric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  guardrailMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abTestPlan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ABTestConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampleSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidenceLevel: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minimumDetectableEffect: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trafficSplit: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  primaryMetric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_satisfaction_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guardrailMetrics: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'safety_violation_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'factual_error_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'response_latency_p99'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>A/B 测试的核心是确保统计显著性。样本量需要根据预期效应大小和置信度水平提前计算，避免过早结论或漏检真实差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估流水线设计\">评估流水线设计</h2><p>将评估自动化为流水线，确保每次训练后都能快速获得全面的质量反馈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass, field&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class EvaluationPipeline:&#10;    model_path: str&#10;    baseline_path: str&#10;    tasks: list[str] = field(default_factory=lambda: [&quot;mmlu&quot;, &quot;hellaswag&quot;])&#10;    custom_test_set: str = &quot;&quot;&#10;    judge_model: str = &quot;gpt-4o&quot;&#10;    min_general_score: float = 0.95&#10;    min_task_score: float = 0.80&#10;&#10;    def run(self) -&gt; dict:&#10;        results = {}&#10;        results[&quot;general_benchmarks&quot;] = self.run_general_benchmarks()&#10;        results[&quot;task_benchmarks&quot;] = self.run_task_benchmarks()&#10;        results[&quot;llm_judge&quot;] = self.run_llm_judge()&#10;        results[&quot;safety_check&quot;] = self.run_safety_check()&#10;        results[&quot;regression_check&quot;] = self.check_regression(results)&#10;        return results&#10;&#10;    def check_regression(self, results: dict) -&gt; dict:&#10;        general = results[&quot;general_benchmarks&quot;]&#10;        passed = all(&#10;            score &gt;= self.min_general_score * baseline_score&#10;            for score, baseline_score in zip(&#10;                general[&quot;current&quot;].values(),&#10;                general[&quot;baseline&quot;].values(),&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;        return {&quot;passed&quot;: passed, &quot;details&quot;: general}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass, field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><s